    backlog:hasBaselineRationale "The public mirror is the one location this project already treats as authoritative for 'what has genuinely shipped' -- backlog_distribution_drift_check_v1_0_0.py already compares the governed copy against it as a standing practice. Reusing it here means the shape-proof baseline is never a second, separately-maintained notion of 'published,' only the one this project already checks elsewhere." .

