    rdfs:label "The new-shape decision itself is a real SHACL rule, not Python logic; a loader only tags data"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "Whether a shape is genuinely new and lacks provenByFixture is decided entirely by NewUnprovenShapeShape's own SPARQL evaluation; a loader's only real role is asserting which real file each shape declaration was found in." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:NewUnprovenShapeShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE, ruled by the owner in session." .

