    rdfs:label "A shared repository's cross-project noise is decided by a real SPARQL rule against a declared sovereign path, not judged by hand each time"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "Whether a remote commit requires real reconciliation is decided entirely by CrossProjectCommitAdvisoryShape reading the commit's own real touched paths against this package's own declared hasSovereignPathPrefix; a loader's only role is recording which paths a commit touched." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:CrossProjectCommitAdvisoryShape , backlog:RemoteCommitShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE, ruled by the owner in session." .

