#################################################################
#  v1.469.0 -- LINEAGE 22, box 2: the adaptive profile decided rule set by rule set (G179).
#  Each rule set outside the adaptive profile was adopted on a copy of this lineage's register (2026-10-30) and the violations it adds were counted.
#################################################################

backlog:Pr_9 a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:ProfileRevision ; rdfs:label "Profile revision 9"@en ; backlog:revisionNumber 9 ; skos:definition "Release 1.469.0 (G179) adds to the adaptive profile the rule set RS_StateReflectsEvidence, the only one of the ten rule sets outside the profile that binds a lineage, adds no violation to the register of the lineage that measured it, and does not wait for a human party."@en .

backlog:Profile_Adaptive backlog:profileIncludes backlog:RS_StateReflectsEvidence .
backlog:RS_StateReflectsEvidence backlog:introducedInRevision backlog:Pr_9 .

fw:Ruling_G179 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G179" ;
    rdfs:label "The adaptive profile includes the rule set that holds work to its evidence, and leaves nine rule sets opt-in, each for a measured reason"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The adaptive profile includes RS_StateReflectsEvidence (adopted on a copy of the register of Lineage 22 it adds 0 violations, and it binds a lineage). It leaves opt-in: RS_MissionHistory (its shapes bind a register, not a lineage, so adopting it for a lineage changes nothing); RS_ClosureCommitAnchor (0 violations today, but it binds the closure report that a lineage writes before the commit that carries it exists; decided again at the closure of Lineage 22); RS_AgentAccountability (38 violations: the step tool records no maker of a move); RS_IndependentVerification (6 violations: no Done story names a party other than its executor as verifier); RS_SeverityAudit_20260909 (11 violations: it grades exclusions that no goal guards, a property of an audit and not of a lineage); RS_HumanOversight and RS_ManagerialIndependence (0 violations, and they bind only work that names a human overseer or a controlling party, which agent-run work does not); RS_LabelConvention and RS_LineageStatus (adopted by the register, so they already bind every lineage)." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:EvidencedWorkStillUnstartedShape , backlog:MissionOutsideLineageShape , backlog:ClosureReportCommitAnchorShape , backlog:TransitionNamesWhoShape , backlog:DoneWithoutVerifierShape , backlog:StaleDispositionShape , backlog:HumanOverseerShape , backlog:ManagerialIndependenceShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v143.0.0, section G179." .
fw:Ruling_G179 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:Pr_9 , backlog:RS_StateReflectsEvidence , backlog:RS_MissionHistory , backlog:RS_ClosureCommitAnchor , backlog:RS_AgentAccountability , backlog:RS_IndependentVerification , backlog:RS_SeverityAudit_20260909 , backlog:RS_HumanOversight , backlog:RS_ManagerialIndependence , backlog:RS_LabelConvention , backlog:RS_LineageStatus .

