# ---- box 1 of fw:L_VerifierSession: opened 2026-11-01T18:54:14Z by backlog_box_step ----

# ---- Lineage 26, box 1: the verifier session record (G184) ----
backlog:RS_VerifierSession a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:RuleSet ;
    rdfs:label "A verifier run records its session, as the Agentic-Systems package defines it"@en ;
    skos:definition "Within an adopting lineage, every run named as verifiedBy for a work item records: the way it was started, the grant of access it started under (who gave it, to which place, when), the verification plan it followed with that plan's digest, the session that carried it out, whether the place it read was unchanged, and a recorded configuration of the verifier definition made before the run; the grant is given before the run starts; and a person is the grantor when the verified item is at or above the lineage's humanApprovalLevel. The terms are those of the Agentic-Systems package, version 0.78.0, used by link and not minted again. A RuleSet because it binds only lineages that adopt it when they open (G184)."@en .
backlog:Pr_11 a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:ProfileRevision ; rdfs:label "Profile revision 11"@en ; backlog:revisionNumber 11 ; skos:definition "Release 1.497.0 (G184) adds to the agentic adaptive profile (AAL) the rule set of the verifier session, so that a lineage opened under it records its verifier sessions as the Agentic-Systems package defines them. The other profiles are not changed."@en .
backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive backlog:profileIncludes backlog:RS_VerifierSession .
backlog:RS_VerifierSession backlog:introducedInRevision backlog:Pr_11 .
fw:Ruling_G184 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G184" ;
    rdfs:label "The verifier of an agentic adaptive lineage records its session to the Agentic-Systems standard"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "A lineage that adopts RS_VerifierSession records, for each verifier run, the way it started, the grant of access with its grantor, place and time, the plan with its digest, the session that carried it out, whether the place was unchanged, and a configuration of the verifier recorded before the run; the grant precedes the run; a person grants when the verified work is at or above the stated approval level. AAL includes the rule set from profile revision 11; the other profiles are unchanged." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:VerifierSessionRecordShape , backlog:VerifierGrantOrderShape , backlog:VerifierConfigurationShape , backlog:VerifierGrantorShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v148.0.0, section G184; test drive and fit-gap of 2026-11-01 against Agentic-Systems v0.78.0." .
fw:Ruling_G184 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_VerifierSession , backlog:Pr_11 , backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive .

# ---- box 2 of fw:L_VerifierSession: opened 2026-11-01T19:59:55Z by backlog_box_step ----

fw:Ruling_G185 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G185" ;
    rdfs:label "The step tool records the verifier session; the order of its start is witnessed, not proved"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "In an agentic lineage the step tool records, at the close of a box, the verifier's plan with its digest, the grant of access, the way it started, the session, whether the governed files were unchanged since the brief was fixed, and a configuration made when the brief was fixed; it stamps the verifier run with the start the builder stated, which must lie between the fixing of the brief and the writing of the review; the iteration and the unit of the box name their overseer, verifier and approver; each item of the overseer's escalation list is a finding. No shape can reach that the verifier started when the builder says or that the builder fixed the brief before the verifier read it: the order is witnessed by file times and the builder's statement, and this ruling says so." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:VerifierSessionRecordShape , backlog:VerifierGrantOrderShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v149.0.0, section G185." .
fw:Ruling_G185 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_VerifierSession .
