# ---- box 2 of fw:L_PlannedDates: opened 2026-11-02T11:09:42Z by backlog_box_step ----

# ---- Lineage 28, box 2: a box carries a base plan (G187) ----
fw:Ruling_G187 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G187" ;
    rdfs:label "A box carries a base plan, and the objective dates follow it"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "Every box opened gets a current base plan: its start and an end predicted from the points of its stories and the pace delivered in earlier boxes. A lineage that adopts RS_PlannedDates is refused a box without one. The end of a finished box is measured against its baseline and is not a move of it; moving a baseline stays a Rebaseline decided by the Owner. The dates of the objectives a box moves are checked against the planned end when the box is opened." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:BoxBasePlanShape , backlog:SilentContainerRebaselineShape , backlog:PlannedDatesShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v151.0.0, section G187; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:22." .
fw:Ruling_G187 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_PlannedDates .

# Added at the close of box 2: the objective of recomputed dates has no other live mover now that its first story is Done; the report of box 3 derives the updated dates of every box.
fw:Config_PD_2_Verifier a agsys:AgentConfiguration ; agsys:isConfigurationOf fw:Exec_Verifier ; agsys:recordedAt "2026-11-02T11:18:41Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; agsys:hasConfigurationItem fw:CfgItem_PD_2_Brief , fw:CfgItem_PD_2_Model .
fw:CfgItem_PD_2_Brief a agsys:ConfigurationItem ; agsys:hasItemKind "brief" ; agsys:hasItemValue "sha256 84d9b0625d6799060106ad8fa5fcda10d3eb8c204f9becd7763c60d9fd6baa1e" .
fw:CfgItem_PD_2_Model a agsys:ConfigurationItem ; agsys:hasItemKind "model" ; agsys:hasItemValue "Claude Sonnet 5.5 (general-purpose agent)" .

# ---- box 3 of fw:L_PlannedDates: opened 2026-11-02T12:17:05Z by backlog_box_step ----

# ---- Lineage 28, box 3: the dates are reported (G188) ----
fw:Ruling_G188 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G188" ;
    rdfs:label "The base, updated and finished dates are reported, the updated date derived and never stored"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The updated date of an objective is derived from the boxes that hold the stories that move it: the end of a finished box, the planned end of an open one. The finished date is the first reading of the unbroken run, ending at the latest reading, in which the objective stood at its target; an objective whose latest reading does not stand at the target is open. The base, updated and finished dates of every objective and the base plan, actual end and variance of every box are reported by backlog_date_report. A report refuses nothing, so no shape can enforce the reporting itself; the shapes name what it reads: a base date backed by a forecast and a base plan for every box. The reporting is carried by the tool and its probe." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:PlannedDatesShape , backlog:BoxBasePlanShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_OPERATING_DISCIPLINE v152.0.0, section G188; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:22." .
fw:Ruling_G188 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_PlannedDates .
fw:Config_PD_3_Verifier a agsys:AgentConfiguration ; agsys:isConfigurationOf fw:Exec_Verifier ; agsys:recordedAt "2026-11-02T12:23:29Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; agsys:hasConfigurationItem fw:CfgItem_PD_3_Brief , fw:CfgItem_PD_3_Model .
fw:CfgItem_PD_3_Brief a agsys:ConfigurationItem ; agsys:hasItemKind "brief" ; agsys:hasItemValue "sha256 be7cc26017fc884cceb9ca715f73a425c26fddaae7241aae6d610dcf904be98b" .
fw:CfgItem_PD_3_Model a agsys:ConfigurationItem ; agsys:hasItemKind "model" ; agsys:hasItemValue "Claude Sonnet 5.5 (general-purpose agent)" .

