fw:Mission_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:Mission ;
    backlog:hasMissionOutcome backlog:Out_InFlight ;
    backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved as worded, on three boxes, each checked by fresh agents (two, two and four reviews). An obstacle has one of seven kinds, drawn from 29 classified findings and the sessions, and a lineage that adopts the rule set is refused an impediment with none (box 1); each kind lists the ways known to clear it, fourteen in all, and a cleared impediment names one its kind lists (box 2); one tool raises, advises on and clears an obstacle, the agent monitor lists open ones in hours with the ways that fit, and the dates report names the obstacles that stood in a late box (box 3). Not claimed: that the catalogue is complete or the list per kind right (three findings are in a kind they do not fit, evidence missing has no way that supplies the evidence, an outside service failing has only a retry); that the shapes fired on real data (this lineage was opened under profile revision 12 and is not bound by the rule set of known impediments); that the one real impediment is a live entry (it was met before the tool existed and entered after the fact); that an agent raises an obstacle when it is stopped, nothing forces it; that the 76 other findings were read." ; rdfs:label "Mission: an obstacle can be named, recorded and cleared"@en ;
    backlog:hasMissionStatement "An obstacle that stops or slows the work of a lineage can be named, recorded and cleared: it has a kind from a known set, each kind has the resolution methods known for it, it is recorded when it is met with the work it blocks, and its clearing records the method used, so that a blocked agent knows what to do next and the register can say why work ran late." ;
    backlog:missionFor fw:Register ;
    backlog:hasMissionOrigin backlog:Origin_OwnerStated ;
    backlog:missionSource "Owner, 2026-11-02 10:35: define the impediments and the possible resolution methods; in many cases we are stopped by such obstacles. Gaps verified 2026-11-02: the Impediment class records an owner, a statement, when raised and when resolved, but no kind and no method; 0 typed impediments in the register; 30 findings of Lineages 21 to 28 name a refusal, a failure or a wait and each carries its remedy only as prose; no tool raises or clears an impediment; the agent monitor reports an item stalled after 24 hours while a box of agents lasts minutes." ;
    backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Mission_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
fw:Out_Mission_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:StageOutput ;
    backlog:outputOfStage backlog:Stage_Mission ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasStateDigest "f8f48ac8bc3918696eaf848eadf180b9de3570c9846d851bec2480e26bb623c9" ;
    backlog:closedAtCommit "backlog-roadmap-framework-v3.1.0 (tag; witnessed by git, not asserted)" ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Mission stage of Lineage 29, opened under the agentic adaptive profile (AAL), profile revision 12, as the default profile. Stage 1 of 5, one release each." .

# ---- Lineage 29: Scope stage ----
fw:Scope_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:ScopeStatement ; rdfs:label "Scope: the obstacles and the ways to clear them"@en ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "Name the obstacles and the ways to clear them and nothing else: (1) a closed set of kinds of obstacle drawn from the obstacles actually met, and every obstacle of Lineages 21 to 28 fits one; (2) the resolution methods known for each kind, none a bypass of a rule, and a cleared impediment names the method used; (3) a tool to raise, advise on and clear an impediment, shown by the agent monitor and the dates report; (4) the other profiles and closed lineages are not changed. Not built: risks that have not occurred, escalation to people other than the Owner, past findings re-recorded as impediments." ;
    backlog:scopeForMission fw:Mission_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Scope_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ;
    backlog:requiresDeliverable fw:Del_IK_D1 , fw:Del_IK_D2 , fw:Del_IK_D3 , fw:Del_IK_D4 ;
    backlog:coversArea fw:Area_IK_Kind , fw:Area_IK_Method , fw:Area_IK_Record , fw:Area_IK_Kept ;
    backlog:hasScopeExclusion fw:Ex_IK_Others , fw:Ex_IK_Packages , fw:Ex_IK_Past , fw:Ex_IK_Risks , fw:Ex_IK_People ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Kind a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Kind: an obstacle has a kind"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-02: 0 typed impediments in the register; 30 findings of Lineages 21 to 28 name a refusal, a failure or a wait and none names its kind; the Impediment class has no kind and no catalogue of kinds exists." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
