    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-02: 0 resolution methods are recorded; the Impediment class records when an obstacle was resolved and not how; each of the 30 findings carries its remedy as prose, none as a method that can be offered again." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ;
    backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
