fw:Find_IK_KindFirstReviewDefects a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_KindsOfObstacle ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The first review found a false scope claim for the refusal of two kinds, findings declared but not checked, only 30 of 105 findings classified without saying how, kinds that overlapped with no tie-break, twelve misplaced findings, unsupported examples, and a probe with no case for the two-kind refusal of an unbound lineage or for the date-plan option added." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Repaired and reviewed again: the scope is stated, a tie-break (cause decides) is written, nine placements were moved and one success lost its kind, the narrative says 29 of 105, and probe cases and a fixture entry were added; the second reviewer confirmed items 1, 2, 3, 5 and 6 and found item 4 partly repaired." .
fw:Find_IK_KindThreePlacementsStillWrong a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_KindsOfObstacle ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "Three findings (the stage script that kept an old status, the undeclared predicate, the entity staged again) are placed as rule refusals but their cause is a tool or generator at fault, so by the written tie-break the counts would be 4 and 14, not 7 and 11; and the finding about an objective that waited on another session's act is placed as a decision waited on although it waited on an act, not a decision." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Not repaired in this box: a repair after the second review would need a third; the next box that touches the catalogue repairs them." .
