# ---- Correction of 2026-11-02, appended: Lineage 29 was closed "Achieved" and that was overstated ----
# Appended, never edited: the records above stay as written. The Out_Achieved outcome of the mission and the closure report remain as they were recorded; the notes below say what they held and what the register now holds true.
fw:Mission_ImpedimentsKnown rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-02T22:04:39Z (correction): the outcome recorded above, Achieved, was overstated. The mission is PARTLY ACHIEVED: the kinds, the ways and the tool exist, but no blocked agent has been shown to raise an obstacle, pick a way and be unblocked in live use, and ten verified gaps stand against it (post-closure findings Find_C29_*), besides two carried over from Lineage 28 (Find_C28_*). Value held until this note: Out_Achieved. The outcome vocabulary of the register has no value for partly achieved; adding one is part of the work that answers these findings." .
fw:CR_ImpedimentsKnown rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-02T22:04:39Z (correction): this closure report called the mission achieved on the lineage's own proxy counts (all five objectives Retrospective). That verdict was overstated; see the note on the mission and the post-closure findings raised the same day. The report is not rewritten." .
