    backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "An obstacle can be named, recorded and cleared, so that a blocked agent knows what to do next" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Del_IK_D6 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ; rdfs:label "6.1 The refusal of an obstacle with no kind has fired on real data; the release preflight runs the vocabulary probe; the scope taxonomy has a parent-child link and a check that every scope item is answered by a goal"@en ;
