# ---- Ruling G198, 2026-11-04: a forecast is shown and discussed before it is kept (the forecast record of Lineage 29) ----
backlog:RS_ForecastDiscussed a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:RuleSet ;
    rdfs:label "A forecast behind a checkpoint is recorded as discussed with the Owner"@en ;
    skos:definition "Within an adopting lineage, the forecast behind each checkpoint date carries a record that it was discussed with the role that decides (forecastDiscussedBy) and when (forecastDiscussedAt, not before the forecast was made). A RuleSet because it binds only lineages that adopt it; a lineage opened earlier is not bound. The date stays a forecast and enforces nothing."@en .
backlog:Pr_14 a owl:NamedIndividual , backlog:ProfileRevision ; rdfs:label "Profile revision 14"@en ; backlog:revisionNumber 14 ; skos:definition "Adds to the agentic adaptive profile (AAL) the rule set that a forecast is recorded as discussed, so that a lineage opened under it shows that its forecast was looked at before its dates were kept. The other profiles are not changed."@en .
backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive backlog:profileIncludes backlog:RS_ForecastDiscussed .
backlog:RS_ForecastDiscussed backlog:introducedInRevision backlog:Pr_14 .
fw:Ruling_G198 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G198" ;
    rdfs:label "A forecast is recorded as discussed with the Owner before its dates are kept"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "A lineage that adopts RS_ForecastDiscussed records, on the forecast behind each checkpoint, that it was discussed with the role that decides and when, not before the forecast was made. AAL includes the rule set from profile revision 14; the other profiles and the lineages opened earlier are unchanged." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:ForecastDiscussedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "LINEAGE_RULING_NARRATIVES v160.0.0, section G198; Owner direction of 2026-11-02 10:22 (G186: the forecast is shown for discussion before the dates are final)." .
fw:Ruling_G198 backlog:rulingDecides backlog:RS_ForecastDiscussed , backlog:Pr_14 , backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive .
