    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The probe takes a copy of the real register, adds an obstacle with no kind to Lineage 29, and judges it with the real validator restricted to the refusal's text; it checks that the real register is clean, that the kindless obstacle is refused by name, that a kinded one is not, and that a kindless one in a lineage that did not adopt the rule is not." ;
