# Appended 2026-11-04 (Lineage 29, story Grantor): the Owner ruled (option 2) that an agent may be recorded as the giver of a reviewer's access when it acts for a named person. Each builder run that granted access (22 runs, not the three the story named) is recorded, now, as acting for the Owner, who directed the work of these lineages. For runs before the ruling this is a recording made afterwards, not something the register showed at the time. The record states it; nothing verifies it.
