# ---- Lineage 29: third stage revision, 2026-11-05: the chain is rebuilt from the Scope stage for the work the lineage still owes and the ten safeguards ----
fw:SRev3_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:StageRevision ; rdfs:label "Third stage revision of Lineage 29: the chain is rebuilt from the Scope stage for what the lineage still owes and for the safeguards against an overstated closure"@en ;
    backlog:revisesLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:revisesFromStage backlog:Stage_Scope ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The second chain led to two closures that were both overstated. Three change requests grow the scope: what the lineage still owes before it can end (each gap found after the first closure traced to its answer, each repair reviewed again, an honest outcome with a reason for each objective); ten safeguards that stop a lineage from being closed as achieved while its gaps and repairs are unanswered, with the method monitored until they enforce; and a stage digest that sees a change of the work that can move an objective. The Mission stands. The Scope, Goal, Objective and Backlog are rebuilt, one commit per stage on the lineage's work branch (G203); the Owner approved the start of this revision on 2026-11-05 07:19 UTC, which is 10:19 Istanbul." ;
    backlog:retractsOutput fw:Out_Scope2_ImpedimentsKnown , fw:Out_Goal2_ImpedimentsKnown , fw:Out_Objective2_ImpedimentsKnown , fw:Out_Backlog2_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
fw:Out_Scope2_ImpedimentsKnown backlog:outputRetracted true .
fw:Out_Goal2_ImpedimentsKnown backlog:outputRetracted true .
fw:Out_Objective2_ImpedimentsKnown backlog:outputRetracted true .
fw:Out_Backlog2_ImpedimentsKnown backlog:outputRetracted true .

# ---- Lineage 29: Scope stage, rebuilt by the third revision ----
fw:Scope3_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:ScopeStatement ; rdfs:label "Scope: the obstacles and the ways to clear them, what the lineage still owes, and the safeguards against an overstated closure"@en ;
    backlog:hasScopeStatementText "Name the obstacles and the ways to clear them and show it in use, and close the lineage only on what is true: the kinds and ways of the first scope are corrected and completed; an obstacle is recorded when it is met and attached to its box; a blocked agent is shown raising, advising on and clearing a real obstacle in a box; the rules about obstacles and about the scope taxonomy are checked; the forecast discussion is recorded and the dates report does not stop; the grantor of the reviewers' access is reconciled; every gap found after the first closure is traced to its answer; every repair made after a review that did not accept is reviewed again; the outcome and every objective carry an honest status with a reason; ten safeguards stop a lineage from being closed as achieved while its gaps and repairs are unanswered, and the stage digests see a change of the work that can move an objective; and the method is monitored until they enforce. Nothing else." ;
    backlog:scopeForMission fw:Mission_ImpedimentsKnown ; backlog:producedByStage fw:Out_Scope3_ImpedimentsKnown ; backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_Derived ;
    backlog:requiresDeliverable fw:Del_IK_D1 , fw:Del_IK_D2 , fw:Del_IK_D3 , fw:Del_IK_D4 , fw:Del_IK_D5 , fw:Del_IK_D6 , fw:Del_IK_D7 , fw:Del_IK_D8 , fw:Del_IK_D9 , fw:Del_IK_D10 , fw:Del_IK_D11 ,
        fw:Del_IK_D12 , fw:Del_IK_D13 , fw:Del_IK_D14 , fw:Del_IK_D15 , fw:Del_IK_D16 , fw:Del_IK_D17 , fw:Del_IK_D18 , fw:Del_IK_D19 , fw:Del_IK_D20 , fw:Del_IK_D21 , fw:Del_IK_D22 , fw:Del_IK_D23 , fw:Del_IK_D24 , fw:Del_IK_D25 , fw:Del_IK_D26 ;
    backlog:coversArea fw:Area_IK_Kind , fw:Area_IK_Method , fw:Area_IK_Record , fw:Area_IK_Kept , fw:Area_IK_Live , fw:Area_IK_Enforce , fw:Area_IK_Reports , fw:Area_IK_Account ,
        fw:Area_IK_Gaps , fw:Area_IK_Repairs , fw:Area_IK_Outcome , fw:Area_IK_Closure , fw:Area_IK_Monitor ;
    backlog:hasScopeExclusion fw:Ex_IK_Others , fw:Ex_IK_Packages , fw:Ex_IK_Past , fw:Ex_IK_Risks , fw:Ex_IK_People ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Gaps a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Gaps after closure: every gap found after the first closure is traced to the work that answers it"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: 13 gaps were found after the first closure; 1 is linked to the work that answers it, 12 are not." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 06-package-provenance/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Repairs a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Repairs reviewed again: a repair made after a review that did not accept is reviewed by a fresh reviewer"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: of the nine boxes, six have one review that did not plainly accept and no later review: three refused as they stood (boxes 6, 7 and 8) and three accepted with defects (boxes 4, 5 and 9)." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 06-package-provenance/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Outcome a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Honest outcome: the mission and every objective carry a status with a reason of its own"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: 19 objectives (14 of the second chain, 5 of the first); none of the 14 carries an achievement status; the vocabulary has no outcome of partly achieved (in flight, achieved and abandoned only)." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Work ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Closure a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Closure safeguards: a lineage cannot be closed as achieved while its gaps and repairs are unanswered"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: the first review of each of the 9 boxes did not plainly accept; 46 of 46 objectives marked retrospective are named as movable by work; 12 of 13 gaps found after a closure have no answering link; 10 of 33 rule sets have no adopter; 7 of 7 achieved lineages have no confirmation by the Owner; 103 of 111 probes name no deliberate fault they catch; no review verdict, reported measure with its query or second reading exists as a record; reviewers' briefs are fixed by their digest but written by hand; a stage digest covers the names of the records of a stage and none of their links, so the work named as able to move an objective can change with no digest changing." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/, 04-documentation/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Monitor a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Monitoring of the method: each safeguard is measured against its baseline until it enforces"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: no monitor of the method is part of the package. A report-only monitor written before its route was set is set aside; run from outside the package it counted 0 of 0 probes, because it reads the probes from its own folder." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "03-tooling/, 06-package-provenance/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .

# ---- Lineage 29: the fifteen deliverables added by the third revision ----
