fw:Obs_IK_Kind3 rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): known contrary evidence: the independent review of box 6 counted 44 findings of the register with no kind (22 of Lineage 29, 14 of Lineage 31, 8 of Lineage 30); the value held here counts only the findings that existed before the first closure of Lineage 29." .
fw:Obs_IK_Account3 rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): known contrary evidence: all 23 grants of access of the register are given by an agent with no authorization record, which the Agentic Systems package now requires (change request CR_C29_GrantAuthorization)." .
fw:Obs_IK_Repairs rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): the value 6 counts the boxes with exactly one review that did not plainly accept. Read as the metric is labelled (the latest review does not plainly accept), the count is 8: boxes 1 and 2 also qualify (their latest reviews read PASSES WITH CONDITIONS and PARTIAL PASS), and only box 3 ends on a plain acceptance." .
fw:Obj_IK_Repairs rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): the baseline 6 counts boxes with exactly one review that did not plainly accept; as labelled, the count is 8 (see the correction on its baseline observation). The target is unchanged: no box ends on a review that does not plainly accept." .
fw:Area_IK_Repairs rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): the measure counts boxes with one review only. Box 6 was not refused: its review reads ACCEPT WITH DEFECTS, not ready to release. Two boxes were refused as they stood (7 and 8), not three; box 6, like boxes 4, 5 and 9, was accepted with defects. Read as boxes whose latest review does not plainly accept, the count is 8 (boxes 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 and 9)." .
fw:Area_IK_Gaps rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): the count was out of date when the scope was committed: 14 gaps were declared for Lineage 29 by then (the fourteenth, on the commits of the second chain, was raised in cf316373bf94, before the scope commit 73a58528f749); 1 is linked, 13 are not." .
fw:Area_IK_Closure rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): two figures of the measure: the gaps are 13 of 14 with no answering link (not 12 of 13, see the gaps area); the probes are counted as a proxy, the probe files of the tooling folder whose source names no mutant or mutation (103 of the 111 files then), not the 77 probes the gate lists." .
fw:SRev3_ImpedimentsKnown rdfs:comment "Appended 2026-11-05 (correction, after the independent review of the batch): the source of the Owner's approval of 07:19 UTC (10:19 Istanbul) is his message of that minute in the session that builds this package, the word Go in answer to the report that ended: the scope revision starts when you say go. Nothing else in the repository records it. This revision first appears in the same commit as the scope stage it rebuilds (73a58528f749)." .
