    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: 66 uses of the tool that verified a record are written as text; no property links an evidence record to its reader." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Measures a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Measures: an objective measures the reality its goal wants, and a goal is read from its objectives"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: 19 objectives of the third chain of this lineage; none names a formula, a confidence tier or an approved table of bands, because the vocabulary has no term for them (the range of the success-metric link is stated nominal and not enforced)." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 04-documentation/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Elements a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Introduced elements: a scope change can name the goals and objectives it introduces, and the stage digests follow"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Counted 2026-11-05: 22 items were re-admitted to the backlog stage by its output, as a disclosed workaround, because the admission link of a scope change accepts a work item only." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/, 03-tooling/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:Area_IK_Taxonomy a backlog:ScopeArea ; rdfs:label "Area: Scope taxonomy: every scope item of every open lineage is answered by a goal, and the check binds lineages already open"@en ;
    backlog:areaMeasure "Read 2026-11-05 from the lineage discipline, not measured by a check: the rule that every scope item has a goal binds only lineages opened from now; in this register 53 of 53 areas have a goal." ;
    backlog:hasScopeLayer backlog:Layer_Product ; backlog:areaLocation "01-ontologies/, 02-shacl-safeguards/" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
