    backlog:hasRationale "Backlog stage of Lineage 29, rebuilt by the fourth stage revision: twelve new stories, Story-direct, all Proposed, each answering one objective and one deliverable of a change request; the fifteen stories of the third chain and the stories and tasks it re-admitted are admitted again by this output as they stand. Stage 5 of 5." .
