    backlog:fulfillsRequest fw:CR_C29_ObstacleBenefit ; backlog:changesScope fw:Scope4_ImpedimentsKnown ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "The Owner decided on 2026-11-06 (ruling G212; 02:51 Istanbul) that the goals are the aims to get the benefits of obstacle management, that each is satisfiable before the lineage closes, and that the methods are proven by a test drive and a field standard. Three goals, three objectives and three deliverables are introduced and three stories admitted. Paid for by time only: no item of the lineage is removed." ;
    backlog:introducesElement fw:Goal_IK_Know5 , fw:Goal_IK_Treat5 , fw:Goal_IK_Prove5 , fw:Obj_IK_Know5 , fw:Obj_IK_Treat5 , fw:Obj_IK_Prove5 , fw:Del_IK_D39 , fw:Del_IK_D40 , fw:Del_IK_D41 ;
