fw:Ev_IK_GvKeep6 a backlog:TestEvidence ; rdfs:label "The check for story GvKeep6"@en ;
    backlog:evidenceVerified true ; backlog:hasTestId "GvKeep6" ;
    backlog:hasTestSpec "03-tooling/backlog_lineage_archive_v2_11_0.py" ;
    backlog:attestsCriterion fw:AC_IK_GvKeep6 ;
    backlog:hasVerificationMethod "The cluster closure of the archive tool counted the run of a live lineage as a candidate for the archive, so the four agent roles went into the archive with the runs of the older lineages and 63 checks of the live lineages failed on a copy of the register. The tool now drops, before the closure, every candidate that touches anything outside the partition and the candidates, and so the subjects that depend on them. A probe on a small register shows the roles staying live, a closed cluster and an event going with the archived lineage, a cluster that touches a live story staying, and catches seven mutants of the tool." ;
    backlog:verifiedAt "2026-11-06T09:23:14Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:verifiedByTool "backlog_lineage_archive v2.11.0, backlog_archive_shared_probe v1.0.0, gate 1.95.0" ;
    backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "03-tooling/backlog_lineage_archive_v2_11_0.py" ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown .
fw:AC_IK_GvKeep6 backlog:satisfiedByArtifact "03-tooling/backlog_lineage_archive_v2_11_0.py" .
fw:H_IK_GvKeep6 a backlog:TestHarness ; rdfs:label "Harness for story GvKeep6"@en ;
    backlog:harnessFor fw:ST_IK_GvKeep6 ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence fw:Ev_IK_GvKeep6 ; backlog:harnessComplete true ;
    backlog:hasRationale "A copy of the register with the seven archivable lineages set down by the new tool, validated by the real validator; the probe on a toy register; two independent reviewers reproduced the cause with the old tool and the result with the new one." .
fw:Demo_IK_GvKeep6 a backlog:DemoRun ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Control ; backlog:demonstratesItem fw:ST_IK_GvKeep6 ; backlog:demonstratedAgainst fw:AC_IK_GvKeep6 ; backlog:demoAt "2026-11-06T09:23:15Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDemoShown "The copy validates CONFORMANT with 0 violations (the old tool gave 63 at the baseline and 64 on the register of 5.4.5); the probe with python3 -I passes all cases and catches all seven mutants." ;
    backlog:hasDemoResult "Setting down the seven lineages no longer removes what the live lineages use. The probe is tied to the exact text of the pruning lines, and it does not exercise the vocabulary keep-live, the register-root protection or a chain of references longer than one step." .
