    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_GvRule6 ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "Six checks read the live records of lineages that were later set down, so setting those lineages down made six checks fail and held back release 5.4.7 once. Nothing in the discipline told the agent that a check must not depend on records a lineage takes with it into the archive." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Applied: the six checks now read the archive too (release 5.4.7) and step 6 of the discipline says it. Open: no check yet finds such a dependency before a lineage is set down." .
