    backlog:urgencyDeclaredAt "2026-11-07T12:43:24Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ; backlog:urgencyReason "A roadmap that names no package validates clean, against the Owner's ruling of 2026-11-07 that a roadmap without packages is not a roadmap (2SISA finding, genuine). Nothing that plans a lineage can be relied on until it is corrected." ; backlog:urgencyTimeBoxUntil "2026-11-10T12:00:00Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;
