    backlog:hasRationale "Scope stage of Lineage 32: three areas, five deliverables, three exclusions, drawn from the Owner rulings of 2026-11-07 and the gap verified that day. Stage 2 of 5." .

# ---- Lineage 32: Goal stage ----
