    backlog:revisesLineage fw:L_RoadmapNeedsPackages ;
    backlog:revisesFromStage backlog:Stage_Goal ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The goals of the first Goal output answered the mission and the three areas but none of the three exclusions, and covered two of the three facings, so the rule set that gives every scope item an answerable goal refused the stage. The Mission and the Scope stand. The Goal stage is rebuilt with one exclusion-facing goal for each exclusion; no later stage had consumed the first output." ;
