fw:Ruling_G220 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G220" ;
    rdfs:label "Packages are scoped from selected backlog items: the whole backlog is in packages, chosen by recorded values, ordered by dependency, ready when derived so"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "For every lineage that adopts RS_PackagesRequired and has its backlog: each live backlog item is a member of exactly one package; an item in a package records a priority score, an impact (business value) and the deliverable it satisfies (its cohesion with the rest of its package), the values a package is chosen by; an item depends only on an item of its own package or of a package its package depends on; a package is Done only when its items are Done and the iterations that target it are Done, never set by hand; and an iteration plans items of one package only. The package-count tool, with its check, names the items placed in no package. The Owner's instruction of 2026-11-07 at 19:57 Istanbul, routed as a change request of Lineage 32 (box 2). The criteria come from a survey of release-planning practice whose sources were not opened; they are to be checked." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:OwnerRulingDatedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "Owner instruction of 2026-11-07 at 19:57 Istanbul, and 'OK, proceed in this way' at 20:01 Istanbul." .
fw:Ckp_RNP_2_1 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "Coverage: Added two shapes: a live backlog item in no package, and one in two packages, each with a test case that fires; the count check names items in no package"@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_RNP_2 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-07T18:54:49Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 4 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
fw:Ckp_RNP_2_2 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "Selection: Added the shape that requires an item in a package to record priority score, impact and the deliverable it serves, with a test case"@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_RNP_2 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-07T18:54:49Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 4 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
fw:Ckp_RNP_2_3 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "Forward: Added the shape that refuses an item leaning on a package its package does not depend on, and the shape that refuses a package marked Done with open items or open sprints"@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_RNP_2 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-07T18:54:49Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 4 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
fw:Ckp_RNP_2_4 a backlog:DailyCheckpoint ; rdfs:comment "SprintScope: Added the shape that refuses an iteration planning items of two packages, with a test case that fires and a good case that passes"@en ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Monitoring ; backlog:checkpointOfBox fw:It_RNP_2 ; backlog:checkpointAt "2026-11-07T18:54:50Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:openItemCount 0 ; backlog:inProgressItemCount 4 ; backlog:doneItemCount 0 .
