fw:Mission_RoadmapNeedsPackages backlog:outcomeRationale "Achieved, confirmed by the Owner on 2026-11-08 at 00:5x Istanbul after the closure report (fw:ClosureReport_RNP): the roadmap rules, the package count and the package-scoping rules are enforced for lineages that adopt RS_PackagesRequired and proven on planted and good cases and by two independent reviews. Stated limits: no live lineage has adopted the rule set yet; the roadmap report does not show the package count; one sprint edge case and a package without a lineage link are open." .

fw:Ruling_G221 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G221" ;
    rdfs:label "Lineage 32 is concluded as Achieved on the Owner's confirmation, and the Governance lineage resumes"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The Owner confirmed Lineage 32 (a roadmap is built from packages) as Achieved after its closure report, with its stated limits: no live lineage has adopted the rule set yet, the roadmap report does not show the package count, and two small gaps are open (a child planned into a sprint whose parent sits in another package; a package with no lineage link). The pause of the Governance lineage is resolved and the Governance lineage resumes." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:OwnerRulingDatedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "Owner answer 'Yes, Achieved' to the closing question, 2026-11-07 about 21:50 UTC (2026-11-08 about 00:50 Istanbul)." .

# ---- Governance lineage planned in packages (G222) ----

fw:Ruling_G222 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G222" ;
    rdfs:label "The Governance lineage is adapted to the package method before it runs on, as a live test of that method"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The Owner directed that the Governance lineage plans its backlog in packages, with a roadmap and sprints planned from package scope, before it runs on, so that the package method is proven live and the Governance lineage disciplines the lineages that follow. The lineage was opened before the package rule set existed and cannot adopt it; it follows the method by choice and is checked as if it had adopted it." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:OwnerRulingDatedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "Owner messages of 2026-11-08 10:27 and 11:06 Istanbul." .

