# ---- Lineage 29: fifth stage revision, the Backlog stage rebuilt in packages (G223) ----
fw:Ruling_G223 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G223" ;
    rdfs:label "The Governance lineage adopts the package rules by a stage revision of its backlog stage"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The Owner decided that the Governance lineage, which was revived and rebuilt its chain by stage revisions, adopts the package rules so that it is bound by the method it tests. The fifth stage revision rebuilds the Backlog stage only; the rules are adopted in the commit where the rebuilt stage first appears, as G192 allows for a revived lineage." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:OwnerRulingDatedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "Owner message of 2026-11-08 15:58 Istanbul (12:58 UTC): the Governance lineage can adopt the package rules, and if its authorization is missing a setup is built; proceed." .
fw:SRev5_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:StageRevision ; rdfs:label "Fifth stage revision of Lineage 29: the Backlog stage is rebuilt with every item placed in a package, and the package rules are adopted"@en ;
    backlog:revisesLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:revisesFromStage backlog:Stage_Backlog ;
    backlog:revisionReason "The Owner directed on 2026-11-08 that the Governance lineage is planned in packages and bound by the package rules as a live test of the method. The fourth backlog stood without packages, a roadmap or planned sprints; the nine packages, the roadmap and the planned sprints of release 5.5.5 are planned on it, and the lineage can adopt the package rules only where its chain is rebuilt (G192). The Mission, Scope, Goal and Objective stages stand; only the Backlog output is replaced, and every item the fourth output held is admitted again as it stands." ;
    backlog:retractsOutput fw:Out_Backlog4_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
fw:Out_Backlog4_ImpedimentsKnown backlog:outputRetracted true .
fw:Out_Backlog5_ImpedimentsKnown a backlog:StageOutput ;
    backlog:outputOfStage backlog:Stage_Backlog ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:consumesOutput fw:Out_Objective4_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasStateDigest "67d2eb1fe4b75592f6cd7bc7ebcdba4bae33538bd78a3302518d50063c41f16b" ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Backlog stage of Lineage 29, rebuilt by the fifth stage revision: no new story; the fifty stories and their tasks that the fourth output held are admitted again as they stand, now placed in nine packages with a roadmap and planned sprints, and the lineage adopts the package rules. Stage 5 of 5." .
