# ---- Lineage 29: lineage duality first, and the tool that opens a planned time-box (G226) ----
fw:Ruling_G226 a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "G226" ;
    rdfs:label "A time-box is a feature of many entities, a package is deployable alone, a release and a deployment are separate concepts, dates are forecasts and objectives are measured in a loop; the role of a lineage comes first"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "The Owner directed that a story is sized to fit one sprint and decomposed when it does not; that a package is not time-boxed but may be, and each package is independently deployable, while a release may carry several packages and wait for a set of them; that a deployment records the details of the deployment process, the packages covered and the version management; that a milestone date is a forecast; that an objective triggers a measurement and is found met or unmet, and when unmet a forecast says when to measure again; that monitoring triggers measures, evaluates the differences between results, shows progress and predicts the future of the goals, the scope and the mission; that the monitor records the forecast it derives and the Owner is consulted when the predicted date of a goal or of the mission moves later; that these rules are held in the framework and bind every lineage that adopts them; and that the formal role of a lineage (governance or production) with the governing link is urgent, because parallel sessions are missing it to build their governance lineages." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape backlog:OwnerRulingDatedShape ;
    backlog:rulingSource "Owner messages of 2026-11-09 at 08:28, 08:53, 08:59 and 09:07, Istanbul time." .
fw:CR_IK_Duality a backlog:ChangeRequest ; rdfs:label "Give every lineage a role and bind a governance lineage to the rules that make it govern; let the time-box tool open a planned time-box"@en ;
    backlog:requestsChangeTo fw:Scope4_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasChangeDirection backlog:Direction_Grow ;
    backlog:hasChangeRequestRationale "Routed under the discipline as work that serves the live mission (route a), not as a separate urgency: the general mission (G224) says each production lineage adapts the general governance mission, and the register cannot say which lineage governs which. Measured on 2026-11-09: 2 lineages, none stating a role; no link from a production lineage to its governor; the five questions of the 2SISA handover are answered only in part (G226 answers the two about forecasts); 28 planned time-boxes that the time-box tool refuses to open because it creates a time-box and cannot open one planned in advance. The Owner ruled the role urgent (G226), so the items are put first in the order of work (the base plans of the planned time-boxes keep their earlier forecasts and a finished time-box is measured against its base plan): the tool story opens first because the planned boxes need it, then the governing link with the role, then the split of a started lineage. The remaining directions of G226 (deployment, release, objective measurement loop, monitoring) enter by their own change request after this one. Planned dates stay forecasts." ;
    backlog:supportsObjective fw:Obj_IK_Mission4 ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasDisposition backlog:Disp_Accepted .
fw:IA_IK_Duality a backlog:ImpactAssessment ; rdfs:label "Impact of the role of a lineage and of opening a planned time-box"@en ;
    backlog:analyzesRequest fw:CR_IK_Duality ;
    backlog:affectsGoal fw:Goal_IK_Duality , fw:Goal_IK_TimeBox , fw:Goal_IK_Governor ;
    backlog:hasImpactStatement "Measured on 2026-11-09: the lineage holds 56 stories; one is added (the tool story, in the package that delivers the time-box deliverable) and the governing link story gains the role of a lineage in its acceptance; it and the split of a started lineage are made first in order of work. One deliverable, one goal and two objectives are introduced under an area already held, so no stage is revised. Paid for by time only: no item is removed." ;
    backlog:callsForItem fw:ST_IK_OpenPlanned , fw:ST_IK_GovernorLink , fw:ST_IK_SplitStarted .
fw:SC_IK_Duality a backlog:ScopeChange ; rdfs:label "Scope change of the Governance lineage: the role of a lineage and the opening of a planned time-box"@en ;
    backlog:fulfillsRequest fw:CR_IK_Duality ; backlog:changesScope fw:Scope4_ImpedimentsKnown ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner ; backlog:belongsToLineage fw:L_ImpedimentsKnown ;
    backlog:hasScopeChangeRationale "The Owner directed on 2026-11-09 (G226) that the role of a lineage is urgent: one deliverable, one goal, two objectives and one story. Paid for by time only: no item is removed." ;
    backlog:introducesElement fw:Del_IK_D51 , fw:Goal_IK_Duality , fw:Obj_IK_Duality , fw:Obj_IK_OpenPlanned ;
    backlog:admitsItem fw:ST_IK_OpenPlanned .
fw:Ruling_G226 backlog:rulingDecides fw:CR_IK_Duality .
