fw:Find_IK_FixtureNotLikeRegister a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_OpenPlanned ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The first review rejected the change: the check that a story is a member of a planned box read only the story's own block, but the register holds that membership as a line appended after the story, so every real planned box would have been refused. The probe passed because its stories had the membership inside their block." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Applied: the check reads both forms and the probe now holds a story whose membership is an appended line, as the register has it. Open: a fixture should be copied from the register's real layout, not written by hand." .
fw:Find_IK_PackageMustTargetBeforeOpen a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_OpenPlanned ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The first attempt to open the box was refused by the package rules because the package that holds the story did not yet target the box, and the box is created by the opening itself. A box that is created at its opening needs its package to name it before it exists." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Applied: the line naming the box was added to the package before the opening was repeated. Open: the story that plans a package should name its first box." .
fw:Find_IK_TwentyThreeBoxesPlannedBeforeTheToolCouldOpenOne a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
    backlog:hasFindingScope backlog:Scope_LineageLocal ;
    backlog:relatesToWorkItem fw:ST_IK_OpenPlanned ;
    backlog:hasRootCause "The packages and 23 time-boxes were planned in advance in release 5.5.5 although the tool could only create a time-box, so none of them could be run. Planning and the tool that runs the plan were not checked against one another." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Applied: the tool story of this box. Open: a check that every planned record can be reached by the tool that runs it." .
fw:Find_IK_ReviewGapsKept a backlog:RetrospectiveFinding ;
