    backlog:harnessFor fw:ST_IK_GovernorLink ; backlog:hasHarnessEvidence fw:Ev_IK_GovernorLink ; backlog:harnessComplete true ;
    backlog:hasRationale "Every new check has a negative fixture case that fires, one good case raises no governance message, the register validates with no violation and one warning, and five independent reviews read the work, the last accepting it." .
fw:Demo_IK_GovernorLink a backlog:DemoRun ; backlog:hasWorkKind backlog:WorkKind_Control ; backlog:demonstratesItem fw:ST_IK_GovernorLink ; backlog:demonstratedAgainst fw:AC_IK_GovernorLink ; backlog:demoAt "2026-11-09T10:09:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasDemoShown "The fixture run shows each governance check firing on its own case and none on the good pair; the register run shows the one warning on the Governance lineage." ;
    backlog:hasDemoResult "The role and the governing link exist and are checked. Two departures from the criteria as written remain, both recorded in the ruling for the Owner to accept or reject: a governance lineage opened before revision 17 gets a warning, not a refusal, because it can adopt the rule set only by a stage revision; and a lineage that states no role and adopts nothing escapes the role duty." .
