    backlog:hasRootCause "The first version made two of the Owner's criteria (a production lineage names its governor, a governance lineage adopts the rule set) only warnings, and gated the link checks on adoption, so the one real link was checked by nothing. The first review rejected it." ;
    backlog:hasRemedy "Applied: both are refusals where the rule set can bind, the link and role checks apply to every lineage, two missing refusals were added. Open: the Governance lineage adopts the rule set only by a stage revision." .
