fw:AC_IK_EpicGroomed a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; backlog:hasGherkinText "Given a lineage that requires packages and an epic groomed into scored stories, When the epic has no package, no score and no closing state of its own, Then no rule refuses it, even Proposed and unscored or in a lineage recorded Achieved; and Given the same epic as a member of a package, Then it is refused." .
