fw:AC_IK_EpicScore a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; backlog:hasGherkinText "Given an epic with an estimated score, When its stories are scored and a roll-up score that replaces the estimate is recorded, Then no rule refuses the epic and only the newest score is live; and Given a roll-up whose value differs from the stories' roll-up, Then it is refused; and Given a lineage at the Backlog stage with no package, Then no package rule refuses it." .
