    backlog:observesMetric fw:Metric_IK_Epic2 ; backlog:observationFor fw:Obj_IK_Epic2 ; backlog:hasObservedValue 0.0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-09T15:41:22Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "Counted on the fixtures of release 5.5.13: the estimate-replaced-by-roll-up epic and the re-scored story epic raise no parent-score, one-live-score or roll-up message, and a lineage at the Backlog stage with no package raises no package message: none of the three rules refuses what the Owner described." .
